<title>USA: Wall Street stocks lower at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks lower at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Streets stocks were mostly lower with bonds on Wednesday after the Dow industrials scored two record closing highs in as many days.</p>
<p>Dow Industrials were off 32 points at 7192.</p>
</text>
